{%- comment -%} Full About Us page — works on default page template via page handle {%- endcomment -%}

<div class="kixro-about-hero">
  <div class="kixro-about-hero__media" aria-hidden="true">
    <img
      class="kixro-about-hero__img"
      src="{{ 'hero-2.png' | asset_url }}"
      alt=""
      loading="eager"
      width="2000"
      height="800"
    >
    <div class="kixro-about-hero__overlay"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="kixro-container kixro-about-hero__content">
    <span class="kixro-about-hero__eyebrow">About Kixro</span>
    <h1 class="kixro-about-hero__title">Step into Confidence</h1>
    <span class="kixro-about-hero__rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <p class="kixro-about-hero__subheading">Premium men's footwear designed for every stride of your journey.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="kixro-about-story">
  <div class="kixro-container">
    <div class="kixro-about-story__grid">
      <div class="kixro-about-story__media">
        <img
          class="kixro-about-story__img"
          src="{{ 'category-shoes.png' | asset_url }}"
          alt="Modern style meets everyday comfort"
          loading="lazy"
          width="900"
          height="900"
        >
      </div>
      <div class="kixro-about-story__content">
        <span class="kixro-section-label">Brand Story</span>
        <h2 class="kixro-section-title kixro-about-story__title">Modern style meets everyday comfort</h2>
        <div class="kixro-about-story__text rte">
          <p>Welcome to Kixro, where modern style meets everyday comfort. Born from a passion for premium footwear, Kixro was created for the young man who demands more from his shoes — more style, more confidence, and more comfort, from the first step of the day to the last.</p>
          <p>We believe that great footwear can transform your confidence, elevate your style, and carry you through every moment with ease. That's why we craft every pair of Kixro shoes with precision, premium materials, and modern designs that feel as good as they look.</p>
          <p>Kixro is more than just a shoe brand — it's a statement of confidence, style, and intentional living. For the trendsetters, the go-getters, and the style-conscious men who walk their own path, Kixro is your perfect companion for every step of the journey.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="kixro-about-values">
  <div class="kixro-container">
    <div class="kixro-about-mission">
      <header class="kixro-about-mission__head">
        <span class="kixro-section-label">Mission & Values</span>
        <h2 class="kixro-about-mission__title">Our Mission</h2>
        <p class="kixro-about-mission__statement">To inspire confidence through modern, premium footwear that combines effortless style with all-day comfort.</p>
      </header>

      <div class="kixro-about-mission__gallery">
        <figure class="kixro-about-mission__figure">
          <img class="kixro-about-mission__img" src="{{ 'about-mission-1.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Kixro premium footwear collection display" loading="lazy" width="1200" height="800">
        </figure>
        <figure class="kixro-about-mission__figure">
          <img class="kixro-about-mission__img" src="{{ 'about-mission-2.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Kixro artisan craftsmanship" loading="lazy" width="1200" height="800">
        </figure>
      </div>

      <div class="kixro-about-values__strip">
        <div class="kixro-about-values__item">
          <h3 class="kixro-about-values__item-title">Premium Quality</h3>
          <p class="kixro-about-values__item-text">We use only the best materials and craftsmanship to ensure every pair feels exceptional.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="kixro-about-values__item">
          <h3 class="kixro-about-values__item-title">Modern Style</h3>
          <p class="kixro-about-values__item-text">Contemporary designs that keep you on-trend and confident.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="kixro-about-values__item">
          <h3 class="kixro-about-values__item-title">All-Day Comfort</h3>
          <p class="kixro-about-values__item-text">Thoughtful construction that supports you from morning to night.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="kixro-about-values__item">
          <h3 class="kixro-about-values__item-title">Confidence</h3>
          <p class="kixro-about-values__item-text">Empowering you to step out with confidence in every moment.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="kixro-about-values__item">
          <h3 class="kixro-about-values__item-title">Authenticity</h3>
          <p class="kixro-about-values__item-text">Genuine design for real men living modern lives.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="kixro-about-philosophy">
  <div class="kixro-container">
    <div class="kixro-about-split-row kixro-about-split-row--style">
      <div class="kixro-about-split-row__content">
        <span class="kixro-section-label">Product Philosophy</span>
        <h2 class="kixro-about-philosophy__title">Style without compromise</h2>
        <div class="kixro-about-philosophy__text rte">
          <p>We believe that footwear should be an expression of your personal style, not a compromise. At Kixro, we blend modern trends with timeless design to create shoes that feel intentional, elevated, and unmistakably you. From versatile loafers to comfortable boots, each pair is crafted to support your lifestyle with premium materials, thoughtful construction, and undeniable style.</p>
        </div>
        <ul class="kixro-about-philosophy__list">
          <li>Everyday confidence — shoes that make you feel polished and put-together</li>
          <li>Effortless style — modern designs that complement your personal aesthetic</li>
          <li>All-day comfort — premium materials and construction that support your every move</li>
          <li>Versatility — footwear that transitions seamlessly from work to weekend</li>
          <li>Intentional living — shoes that reflect your confidence and ambition</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="kixro-about-split-row__media">
        <img class="kixro-about-split-row__img" src="{{ 'about-style.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Style without compromise" loading="lazy" width="1000" height="750">
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="kixro-about-split-row kixro-about-split-row--reverse kixro-about-split-row--accent">
      <div class="kixro-about-split-row__content">
        <span class="kixro-section-label">Lifestyle & Community</span>
        <h2 class="kixro-about-philosophy__title">Walk your own path</h2>
        <div class="kixro-about-philosophy__text rte">
          <p>Kixro is made for men who walk their own path with confidence and purpose.</p>
        </div>
        <ul class="kixro-about-philosophy__list">
          <li>Young men stepping into their confidence</li>
          <li>Trend-conscious individuals who value modern style</li>
          <li>Go-getters who need footwear that keeps pace with their ambitions</li>
          <li>Men who believe that great shoes make a statement</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="kixro-about-split-row__media">
        <img class="kixro-about-split-row__img" src="{{ 'about-path.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Walk your own path" loading="lazy" width="1000" height="750">
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="kixro-about-split-row kixro-about-split-row--promise">
      <div class="kixro-about-split-row__content kixro-about-promise__content">
        <span class="kixro-section-label">Our Commitment</span>
        <h2 class="kixro-about-promise__title">Our Promise</h2>
        <ul class="kixro-about-promise__list">
          <li>Premium materials that feel luxurious</li>
          <li>Modern designs that elevate your style</li>
          <li>All-day comfort that supports your lifestyle</li>
          <li>Confidence in every step</li>
          <li>Footwear designed for the modern man</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="kixro-about-promise__closing">Step into confidence with Kixro.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="kixro-about-split-row__media">
        <img class="kixro-about-split-row__img" src="{{ 'about-promise.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Our Promise" loading="lazy" width="1000" height="750">
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="kixro-about-cta-outer">
  <div class="kixro-about-cta">
    <div class="kixro-about-cta__bg" aria-hidden="true">
      <img src="{{ 'about-cta-banner.png' | asset_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy" width="1920" height="800">
    </div>
    <div class="kixro-about-cta__overlay" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <div class="kixro-about-cta__inner">
      <h2 class="kixro-about-cta__title">Ready to upgrade your footwear?</h2>
      <p class="kixro-about-cta__text">Discover the perfect pair that combines premium style and all-day comfort.</p>
      <div class="kixro-about-cta__actions">
        <a href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}" class="kixro-btn kixro-btn--white kixro-btn--lg">Shop All Shoes</a>
        <a href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}" class="kixro-btn kixro-btn--secondary kixro-btn--lg kixro-about-cta__btn-secondary">Explore Collections</a>
      </div>
      <p class="kixro-about-cta__seo">Looking for premium men's footwear designed with modern style and everyday comfort in mind? Discover Kixro's collection of modern shoes, boots, loafers, and sandals crafted for young men who value confidence and style.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
